<tr><td><em>Echinococcus</em> spp.</td><td>Firm 皮下（或肌肉）結節，usually single but may be multiple，may feel fluctuant，nontender；rarely fistulization（<em>E. multilocularis</em>）；true cutaneous lesions are rare</td><td>Abdomen</td></tr>
