<tr><td><em>Taenia multiceps</em>（coenurosis）</td><td>Solitary 皮下（或肌肉）nodule，usually <strong class="ex-n">2–6 cm</strong>，painless</td><td>Trunk（especially intercostal）、anterior abdominal wall</td></tr>
